e  enforcement regime for this deal  as well as a  number of sort of unrelated issues on  national security and particularly on  the huawei the the Chinese telecom firm  it seems pretty clear to me that part of  the reason for his motivation to get  this deal was to get some relief for  farmers and to put a boost into the  macro economy in the US as he heads into  reelection and and comes off of what was  a very damaging week for him politically  here in Washington
 

